### GET /api/reports/saved/{id}/run — Runs a saved report under the owner's current scope (as JSON or CSV with ?format=csv)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/saved/{{id}}/run
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
